⚡🇹🇭Former Thai parliamentarian Chalong Riewrang shot and killed a Nonthaburi local administration official in broad daylight outside his office over a financial dispute. The man was subsequently arrested.

⚡🇦🇪🇮🇪The United Arab Emirates extradited 49-year-old Daniel Kinahan, one of the three leaders of the eponymous criminal group active for over thirty years in drug trafficking and illegal arms trade, to Ireland.

@medmannews

⚡🇪🇺 Manfred Weber, a member of the European Parliament in the EPP, calls for a binding plan against illegal migration at the next European Council, with accountability, deadlines, and verifiable goals. 

He proposes hubs for repatriation in Africa and the transformation of Frontex into a European agency with 50,000 operators.

